<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#212529;">Reset your password</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;color:#6c757d;">Someone requested a password reset for <strong style="color:#212529;"><%= @resource.email %></strong>. Click the button below to choose a new one.</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 28px;text-align:center;">
  <%= link_to "Change my password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token),
      style: "display:inline-block;background-color:#0d6efd;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;" %>
</p>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#adb5bd;">If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email — your password will remain unchanged.</p>
